Exponent algebra -- decomposition law, factorization episodes, policy
=====================================================================

Contamination ledger: the three exponent laws, the w-axiom and both
taught factorizations are operator-supplied. The decomposition law's
conclusion carries ?t free -- it can only fire toward a goal, the
case that exposed defect 6 (goal-directed firing). The bidirectional
product/sum laws run in every attempt and reach fixpoint under the
firing budget. Two measured episodes anti-unify into the policy
  (eq _0 (times _1 _2)) -> (rule () (eq _0 (times _1 _2)))
and the held-out problem receives the instantiated prediction.

